# **Product Requirements Document (PRD)**

## **AI ArchViz Studio — Node-Based Architectural AI Creation Platform**

Product Blueprint · Version 1.0

**Product vision:** Build a professional, node-based AI architectural visualization studio that combines image generation, intelligent image editing, segmentation, annotation, reference-image control, architectural design presets, climate and mood simulation, and image-to-video generation.

The product will combine the workflow flexibility of ComfyUI with a visual editing canvas, architecture-specific AI controls, and a professional real-time preview experience.

The goal is to let architects, interior designers, visualization artists, and real estate developers create, modify, and animate architectural designs without rebuilding scenes from scratch.

