&#x20;Copy reference configurationThese percentages are product-level control targets. Each AI adapter must map them to supported model parameters; they are not universal ComfyUI weights.

Each reference must store its asset ID, purpose, target region, influence setting, crop, preprocessing settings, and provenance. The workflow must support missing references, conflicting instructions, and reusable reference sets.

